HITL = Human-In-The-Loop

Sometimes an AI agent should not automatically perform an important action.

Example:

Agent
 ↓
Generate refund
 ↓
Human approval
 ↓
Approve?
 ↓
Execute refund
Why?

For:

Financial transactions
Medical decisions
Legal actions
Sending sensitive emails
Deleting data
Production changes

HITL adds safety.
